---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="About Avinovo — a slow writing project about living with intention, choosing well, and paying attention."
>
  <div class="about-page">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="about-inner">
        <header class="about-header">
          <h1>About</h1>
        </header>

        <div class="prose">
          <p>
            Avinovo is a small writing project about the quiet parts of a life — the morning rituals,
            the tools that earn their keep, the books that change something, the choices that accumulate
            into a way of living.
          </p>

          <p>
            I write slowly and publish infrequently. These essays are meant to be read without hurrying.
          </p>

          <h2>What this is</h2>

          <p>
            Most of what I write falls somewhere in the territory of intentional living — not in the
            aspirational influencer sense, but in the more ordinary sense of trying to choose things
            that are worth choosing, and notice what's actually happening.
          </p>

          <p>
            The categories are loose: lifestyle, home, books, and occasionally the objects that make
            daily life better. When something is an affiliate link, it's clearly marked and only included
            because I actually use it.
          </p>

          <h2>The name</h2>

          <p>
            Avinovo doesn't mean anything in particular. It felt like the right shape for this kind of project —
            clean, a little European, unhurried.
          </p>

          <h2>Get in touch</h2>

          <p>
            If something resonated or you have a question, you're welcome to write.
            The best essays here started as things someone said out loud and then wanted to think through more carefully.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-page { padding-block: var(--space-xl) var(--space-2xl); }

  .about-inner {
    max-width: var(--content-width);
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  .about-header {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-lg);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .about-header h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 400;
  }
</style>
